      "text": "Uses repeaters to pass signals in one direction. It is simple to install but highly\nvulnerable to a single link break.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Uses repeaters to pass signals in one direction. It is simple to install but highly vulnerable to a single link break.",
